1. **Offline single-player only.** The Software must not be used in any online multiplayer
   session, online server, online competition, or any ranked / rewarded / competitive
   environment. Using memory-editing tools online may violate the game's terms and lead to a
   permanent ban; you accept that risk entirely.
2. No selling, no commercial use, no charging for the Software or any derivative of it.
3. Copyright, licence and disclaimer notices must not be removed or altered.
4. No circumvention of any DRM, and no infringement of third-party rights.
5. Redistribution is allowed only in unmodified, complete form, together with this licence.

**Memory access.** The Software reads and writes game process memory. Account bans, corrupted
saves or any other damage are the user's sole responsibility; the author gives no warranty and
accepts no liability.

**User-imported videos.** The "import my video" feature re-encodes a video supplied by the user,
locally, so the game can play it. Such videos are not part of the Software and are never
distributed with it. The user is responsible for holding the necessary rights to any video they
import. Nothing is uploaded; conversion happens entirely on the local machine.

**Privacy.** The Software does not connect to the internet (other than its own services on
127.0.0.1), collects no personal data and contains no telemetry. Settings and logs stay on the
local machine.

**Third-party components.** Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime (Microsoft licence, not bundled);
FFmpeg (LGPL/GPL, downloaded by the user on demand, not bundled); Windows system fonts (not
bundled). Assetto Corsa Competizione is a trademark of Kunos Simulazioni / 505 Games; this is an
unofficial third-party tool with no affiliation, sponsorship or endorsement.

**Disclaimer.** THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR
PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR
OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN
CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.
